      "type": "weightBased",
      "unit": "mg",
      "dose": {
        "perKgPerDay": 10,
        "perKgPerDayMax": 15,
        "dividedDoses": 3
      },
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-gabapentin",
          "section": "2.2"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        {
          "text": {
            "fa": "طی حدود ۳ روز به نگهدارنده: ۳ تا ۴ سال ۴۰ mg/kg/day؛ ۵ تا ۱۱ سال ۲۵ تا ۳۵ mg/kg/day (سه نوبت). تا ۵۰ mg/kg/day مصرف شده.",
            "en": "Titrate over about 3 days to maintenance: 3–4 y 40 mg/kg/day; 5–11 y 25–35 mg/kg/day (three doses). Up to 50 mg/kg/day has been used."
          },
          "refs": [
            {
              "source": "fda-gabapentin",
